@startuml process_view_uc01_register_phase1_monolithique
title UC-01: User Registration (Phase 1 Monolithique)
autonumber

actor Client
participant "API Router" as Router
participant "Identity Handler" as Handler
participant "Identity Service" as Identity
participant "UserService (Bcrypt)" as Bcrypt
database "MySQL" as DB

Client -> Router: POST /api/v1/identity/register
Router -> Handler: Forward Request
Handler -> Identity: RegisterUser(req)
activate Identity
Identity -> Bcrypt: Hash Password
Bcrypt --> Identity: Hashed Password
Identity -> DB: INSERT INTO users (Status: PENDING)
DB --> Identity: Success
Identity --> Handler: User Registered
deactivate Identity
Handler --> Client: 201 Created

@enduml
